{
  "bodyHash": "497aa9c2ab78cd6d",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Polytone</span></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\" width=\"163\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/social/twitter-plural/cozy.svg\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\" width=\"189\" height=\"55\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"YouTube 頻道\" width=\"183\" height=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7SXNHTv.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>📖 關於 📖</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Polytone 是一款客戶端自訂模組，允許您透過<strong>資源包<br><br><br></strong>對遊戲的各個方面進行廣泛調整。本模組在 <a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/polytone/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>維基頁面</strong></a> 提供詳細的文件說明，並包含範例資源包。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您有任何問題，歡迎隨時與我聯繫。請記得將 Polytone 加入您資源包的「可選依賴項」部分。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">主要功能包括：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自訂<strong>客戶端粒子效果</strong> <strong>✨</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自訂<strong>後處理着色器 🌅</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>實體模型粒子發射器 🦋</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自訂<strong><strong>客戶端音效 🎵</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>自訂創意模式標籤頁 🏷️</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>設定畫面</strong> 用於停用<strong>資源包覆蓋層 🔧</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">移動 GUI 欄位 🗓️</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>新增 GUI 元素</strong> 📒</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>自訂物品模型</strong>🗡️</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">修改<strong>現有粒子效果🖌️</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>新增/移除<strong>物品提示文字</strong>&nbsp;🪡</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>更改物品稀有度💍</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自訂<strong>地圖顏色 </strong><strong>🗺️</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">更改<strong>方塊音效 🪅</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自訂方塊<strong>色彩映射 🎨</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>自訂<strong>粒子顏色🍭</strong></strong><strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">方塊偏移類型 📐</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">依時間變動的動態貼圖☀️</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>液體色彩映射 🍸</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自訂<strong>生物群系顏色與粒子 🌄</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>更改<strong>生怪蛋顏色 🐣</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自訂<strong>天空顏色 🌈</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">註冊音效事件 🔔</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">更改雲層高度與天空顏色 ☁️</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>以及更多功能！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它還提供與先前 Optifine 所提供的 <strong>color.properties</strong> 系統的向下相容性，使現有資源包中的相關功能也能正常運作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組設計注重速度與輕量化，同時盡可能保留最多的自訂選項。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它不僅提供了 color.properties 系統的替代方案，還提供了過去無法取得的更多功能與自訂選項。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎在您的資源包中使用此橫幅，並務必在下方留言區展示您的創作！</span><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polytone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/788/551/polytone_banner2.png\" alt=\"polytone_banner\" width=\"250\"></a></p>\n<p>若您使用的是 Sodium 1.20，請注意某些功能可能無法正常運作。最明顯的問題來自於 <a href=\"https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium-fabric/issues/2298\" rel=\"nofollow\">此 Sodium 錯誤</a>。</p>\n<p>建議改用 Embeddium。</p>\n<p>此外，請查看此網站 <a href=\"https://github.com/LambdAurora/optifine_alternatives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/LambdAurora/optifine_alternatives</a><br><br>目前積極支援的 Polytone 版本：</p>\n<p><strong>1.20.1, 1.21.1, 1.21.5, 1.21.11</strong></p>\n<p><strong>若您不希望遇到錯誤並想要體驗所有最新功能，請避免使用其他版本。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7SXNHTv.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>📦 已知資源包📦</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffogulous\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fogulous</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpolyshader%252fgallery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/polyshader/gallery</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fvisual-effects-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/visual-effects-plus</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252funique-goat-horns%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/unique-goat-horns/</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/shrimps-distinct-potions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/shrimps-distinct-potions</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fvariant-paintings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/variant-paintings</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4cy5s2UN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/4cy5s2UN</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/minecraft-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/minecraft-reimagined</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252flight-leak%252fversion%252f1.4.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/light-leak/version/1.4.0</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/golden-days\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/golden-days</a>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rainbows-foliage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rainbows-foliage</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fknishles-beautiful-colormap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/knishles-beautiful-colormap</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sunbathing-godrays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sunbathing-godrays</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/iron-oceans-blood-oceans-inspired-by-iron-lung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/iron-oceans-blood-oceans-inspired-by-iron-lung</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>想讓您的資源包在此展示嗎？歡迎隨時與我聯繫。<br><br>此列表並非完整收錄，僅包含社群提交至此的資源包。<br><br>小撇步：請查看上方的「相依性」區塊，以查看所有已知的資源包。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7SXNHTv.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Polytone 是一款<strong>免費</strong>模組</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜歡<strong>Polytone 資源包</strong>嗎？歡迎考慮捐贈<br>製作模組花費了我大量時間，如果您喜歡我的作品並希望支持我，可以在此進行。捐贈者將獲得專屬的客製化<strong>Globe（地球儀）</strong>和<strong>Statue（雕像）</strong>！若您使用折扣碼 \"supplementaries\" 在 Akliz 購買伺服器，同樣適用此獎勵。<br><br>也歡迎提出更多功能建議！我很樂意聆聽您的想法。<br><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要伺服器嗎？來看看 Akliz，他們專為模組版 Minecraft 提供頂級品牌伺服器。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">他們的社群氛圍非常溫馨，支援服務出色，伺服器效能極佳。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用折扣碼 \"supplementaries\" 可享<strong>20% 折扣</strong>，同時也能支持我！</span><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7SXNHTv.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我們的模組🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"Carpeted Stairs\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"Moyai\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"Jeed\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"Better Lily Pads\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"Advancement Frames\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"Randomium\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-tight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/788/418/638141921847312709.png\" alt=\"Sleep Tight\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heartstone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/555/637793261935851502.gif\" alt=\"Heartstone\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
